          <Pad Id="TGaZZRVFfQkN0fqwVlLhOU" Bounds="629,141,288,193" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="1) Open the Public Channel Browser (Ctr+F4) to see the values the wall PC sends to the floor PC via the OSC binding on the Public Channels&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;2) In the Public Channel Browser use &quot;PreviewFloor&quot; to toggle between wall and floor preview&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;3) Select the output window and press F4 to toggle on the debug view and see the camera">
